Dear all,



I'm trying to used Linaro toolchain to build Aarch64 images, but this
toolchain require all libraries must be deployed under
/lib/<arch-linux-gnu>, /usr/lib/<arch-linux-gnu>.



I already made external-linaro-toolchain.bb to install all toolchain's
libraries in corrected location(meant under /lib/<arch-linux-gnu> and
/usr/lib/<arch-linux-gnu>, but other libraries generated by Yocto right now
will install to default location is /lib and /usr/lib.



Do we have any way to ask Yocto generate libraries to
/usr/lib/<arch-linux-gnu> ?



Thanks,

--
Uy Van

